{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222090","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1522209001:0":{"text":"Y-you're with the lieutenant, right? I-I'm not slacking! I'm doing my job!","source_cn":"你们是跟着副将的那些人……我、我没有偷懒！我在认真发粮食！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A559CFE623C7FF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522209002:0":{"text":"Relax. We're just curious about how the relief food is being handled.","source_cn":"不必紧张，我们只是好奇赈灾粮的发放情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7A3A3BECE9131D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522209003:0":{"text":"But you brought a Wildborn with you... I can't say anything.","source_cn":"但是你们还带着一个兽人……我不能说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7449C3F832BF855B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522209004:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog93>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC693D3730DDCF945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1522209004":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog93>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC693D3730DDCF945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522209005:0":{"text":"We're only asking about the food situation. Nothing military.","source_cn":"我们询问的只是赈灾粮的情况，绝非呼临城的军事机密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB8B4558FBF53D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522209006:1":{"text":"I swear on the name of the Arcane Council, none of this info would change anything on the battlefield, even if the Wildborn's army heard every word.","source_cn":"我以魔法师协会的品格担保，即使这些信息流向战场，传入雅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x883218173E1268FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522209007:0":{"text":"The Arcane Council...\nYou're that mage who visits the city often, aren't you?","source_cn":"魔法师协会……\\n你就是那个经常来城里的魔法师？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2A6B27A1F760B4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522209008:0":{"text":"That's right.","source_cn":"正是。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x547FB780909271DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522209009:0":{"text":"Heard you've healed a lot of folks here... Alright, guess it's no secret.","source_cn":"我听说你给不少人都治过病……好吧，反正也没什么机密。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2301DD795396D36D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522209010:0":{"text":"Ever since the drought and the famine hit, <style=\"highlight\">the city's food has only gotten scarcer</style>. Especially after the troops marched out to fight the Wildborn, most of our reserves went with them.","source_cn":"自打闹了旱灾和饥荒，<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5261F066B476C753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522209011:1":{"text":"At first, the relief came often enough. But with the war dragging on, we can't keep up like before...","source_cn":"最开始赈灾粮发放得还算频繁。但战争一直没结束，我们已经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33654934B40B31B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522209012:0":{"text":"This one wasn't even planned—it came because the Regulus gave the order himself.","source_cn":"就拿这次来说吧。这次的赈灾粮是领主特意下令，在原本的计...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51920B87F2660BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522209013:0":{"text":"I heard the council was against it at first, but <style=\"highlight\">General Perseus overruled them and made it happen</style>.","source_cn":"据说议事官们起初都不同意，<style=highlig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86BAA02473CFE188","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522209014:0":{"text":"Prioritizing war over feeding people? Some governance.","source_cn":"为了打仗不叫人吃饭？这治邦之道还真是有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28BC400EAC4747A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522209015:1":{"text":"No one thought the war would last this long...","source_cn":"谁能想到战争会持续这么久……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3322A41D455A2000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522209016:1":{"text":"But the general's already taken one of the Wildborn camps. Shouldn't be long before we get our hands on their food supplies!","source_cn":"不过统帅已经攻下兽人的一座营地了，应该用不了太久，就会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6CF4E74767D9D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:22:1522209016":{"text":"But the general's already taken one of the Wildborn camps. Shouldn't be long before we get our hands on their food supplies!","source_cn":"不过统帅已经攻下兽人的一座营地了，应该用不了太久，就会有兽人的食物填补上城内的空缺！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB6CF4E74767D9D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522209017:0":{"text":"Thanks for being open. What you've told us will help the Arcane Council figure out how to ease the suffering here.","source_cn":"感谢你的慷慨分享。这些信息一定能帮助魔法师协会了解呼临...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71567CDB451FD823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:0:1":{"text":"I wouldn't count on it.","source_cn":"恐怕没那么简单","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7B5C7EC3CA00E82F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I wouldn't count on it.","female":"I wouldn't count on it.","variant_male_record_index":"77554","variant_female_record_index":"77555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:1:2":{"text":"Those might not be enough.","source_cn":"那些食物可能还不够前线吃的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x365C583AEE2DCA4C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Those might not be enough.","female":"Those might not be enough.","variant_male_record_index":"77556","variant_female_record_index":"77557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:22:2:3":{"text":"Hopefully...","source_cn":"但愿吧……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE728AAEF36FE2B63","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hopefully...","female":"Hopefully...","variant_male_record_index":"77558","variant_female_record_index":"77559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"(Glare at the soldier)","source_cn":"（瞪着士兵）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E4C12E4D7379AE0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_sam